<title>PORTUGAL: Oporto derivatives trade interrupted.</title>
<headline>Oporto derivatives trade interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) was interrupted due to technical problems and should resume at 0930 GMT, a bourse official told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
